==Trivia==
*When the [[Chambers of Xeric]] was {{UD|Chambers of Xeric|released}}, two shamans were added into the [[Lizardman Settlement]]. Unlike the shamans at the [[Lizardman Canyon|canyon]], these did not require 100% [[favour]]. This led to backlash, as it removed the primary incentive to gain [[Shayzien]] favour. These shamans were eventually removed in favour of a [[Slayer task|task-only]] area on [[13 July]] [[2017]]. In the same update, safespots in the canyon were removed.
*On release, shamans could summon spawns in quick succession. This was changed in {{UD|PvM QoL updates & Wilderness Rejuvenation improvements|an update}} on [[8 February]] [[2018]].
*It's possible to click on the shaman's hitbox during its jump attack. However, it cannot be attacked until it has landed.
*[[Poison dynamite]] cannot be used on lizardman shamans.
*Lizardman shamans enjoy eating [[chilli potatoes]].{{CiteNPC|npc=Kaht B'alam|quote=If you come thisss way again, could you bring more of thossse chilli potatoesss? Our ssstocksss have dwindled lately...|loc=Postbag from the Swamp}}

